{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/152012-rules-to-survive-the-world-of-darkness","id":152012,"title":"Rules to Survive the World of Darkness","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-28T19:48:25-07:00","id":152012,"title":"Rules to Survive the World of Darkness","content":"We all played, we all had experiences. both good , bad or worst.<br /> This thread is not to discuss systems or things like that. its more like a guide of things you just dont do, things to avoid, and things to do.<br /> <br /> First rule of the WoD, We Do not Break The Masquerade (any kind of masquerade)<br /> Second Rule of the WoD, We DO NOT break the masquerade (any kind of masquerade)<br /> Third Rule: Insane Is not equal to stupid.<br /> Fourth Rule: IF you meet and earthbound and youre not a demon, you run. you just lost the game.<br /> Fifth Rule: Never trust pentex.<br /> Sixth Rule: If the Technocracy is involved, youre doing something incredibly stupid.<br /> Seventh Rule: Avoid the terrorist known as Joshua Matthews.<br /> Eight Rule: No Suveneirs or Mementos from Hunted Houses.<br /> Nine Rule: If the myth busters can call it a fake, then your magic effect is vulgar.<br /> Tenth Rule: Time Travel is always fucked up. Specially if youre a mage.<br /> Eleventh Rule: Any guy who wears sunglasses and trenchcoat by night is obviously a vampire.<br /> Twelve Rule: Vampires only sparkle for one microsecond before they burst to flames.<br /> Thirteen Rule: If youre a changeling and you see a guy wearing a dark suit and sunglasses and possibly an earpiece, dont shake hands with him, he has the Tecnocracian High Five of Doom.<br /> Fourteen Rule: Never bet against the nuwisha<br /> Fifthteen Rule: If youre the ghoul of a Tzimisce, you might need to change your name to Cronemberg fuck toy or to Eldtrich Abomination.<br /> <br /> <br /> Keep adding your own rules.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-28T20:58:23-07:00","id":152069,"title":"","content":"I will admit, Rule Twelve and Rule Thirteen made me laugh.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1604-oliver-the-bold","name":"Oliver the Bold","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T02:23:11-07:00","id":152275,"title":"","content":"Myth Busters are operatives of New World Order. They reinforce the technological paradigm among the population.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T04:44:59-07:00","id":152361,"title":"","content":"I got these off some Mage site years back. <br /> <br /> 1. Pick one faith and stick with it. Dilettantism is the mark of the amateur. <br /> <br /> 2. Avoid needless embarrassment. Practice the correct pronunciation of your gods name in the privacy of your room before chanting it in public. Flash cards are often helpful. <br /> <br /> 3. Never invoke anything bigger then your head. <br /> <br /> 4. Avoid all cabalistic jewelry over 10 pounds in weight. --it attracts unwelcome attention from tourists, policemen, various supernatural creatures, and can be downright dangerous during thunderstorms. You're just asking for trouble. <br /> <br /> 5. Citronella candles may not be used in rituals. I cannot stress this enough. Pastel-colored candles in the shape of cute animals are like beacons to the Dark Lords. <br /> <br /> 6. Always keep your kit with you: candles, chalk, incense, silver knife, thugee chord, service revolver, garlic, cab fare, condoms, and spare change... <br /> <br /> 7. Select ceremonial robes that are easy to run in while still affording ample concealment. <br /> <br /> 8. When a religious artifact begins emitting light, CLOSE YOUR EYES. <br /> <br /> 9. Contrary to historic belief, drugs and invocations do not mix. When the shit comes down it is vitally necessary to be able to discern between the gibbering monstrosity to throw holy water at, and the gibbering monstrosity that will go away after a few hours, some B-complex and a hot bath. <br /> <br /> 10. Never play strip tarot. <br /> <br /> 11. Fluorescent lighting is very annoying to most nether worldly creatures. <br /> <br /> 12. Followers who have a speech impediment should be excused from speaking parts in any and all ceremonies. The mispronunciation of the deity's name can have catastrophic effects. <br /> <br /> 13. If the ritual site has some strange powder sprinkled around that wasn't there the last time, postpone all ceremonies until the site is verified.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T07:54:30-07:00","id":152497,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=Darling_Rose;n152361]I got these off some Mage site years back.<br /> <br /> <br /> 2. Avoid needless embarrassment. Practice the correct pronunciation of your gods name in the privacy of your room before chanting it in public. Flash cards are often helpful.<br /> <br /> 5. Citronella candles may not be used in rituals. I cannot stress this enough. Pastel-colored candles in the shape of cute animals are like beacons to the Dark Lords.<br /> <br /> 6. Always keep your kit with you: candles, chalk, incense, silver knife, thugee chord, service revolver, garlic, cab fare, condoms, and spare change...<br /> <br /> 8. When a religious artifact begins emitting light, CLOSE YOUR EYES.<br /> <br /> 9. Contrary to historic belief, drugs and invocations do not mix. When the shit comes down it is vitally necessary to be able to discern between the gibbering monstrosity to throw holy water at, and the gibbering monstrosity that will go away after a few hours, some B-complex and a hot bath.<br /> <br /> 10. Never play strip tarot.<br /> <br /> 11. Fluorescent lighting is very annoying to most nether worldly creatures.<br /> <br /> <br /> ok im mystiified by Strip Tarot now. xD<br /> <br /> IF the technocracy beacons a &quot;Dont Panic&quot; message, Do panic in an unoderly fashion.<br /> If a guy looks like a metalhead rider from hell in the middle of daylight and is very into symbolic tattos...he is a werewolf<br /> if a guy uses a long trenchcoat, glasses probably and goes around with books in the middle of the daylight. He is a mage<br /> if a guy goes around looking very pale, speaking on a glorified and romantic way and wearing strangecloths and having silly walks and enjoying being nearby childrens..he is Not a changeling, you might be facin Michael Jackson or Michael Jacksons Wraith/Risen. <br /> <br /> <br /> Remember the Demonic Scalle of Proportional Fucked Up.<br /> The more tentacles/eyes/wings/mouths/cock and or vagina or neither or both/claws has, the more fucked up youre. <br /> throwing holy water at demons doenst always works, but its a hell to piss off a demon.<br /> <br /> As a starter kit in any game you will recibe, a cool trenchcoat, sunglasses, and very likely a katana.<br /> <br /> If your character watches anime, he will become a moving bullseye for anyone, including his own faction.<br /> <br /> Invest in the katana business.<br /> <br /> The best way to get yourself corrupted, is to do &quot;the conga line of corruption&quot; on the spiral to the wyrm. (Yes, please someone draw all the baddies wyrm tainted characters like sasha vykos or zyzzak doing a conga line) <br /> <br /> If you pray a god and he doesnt responds, youre normal. if you pray a god and voices tell you to kill, youre very likely to be a hunter or a esquitzo....congrats, you might be both.<br /> <br /> Stephen King is inmune to changeling influence.<br /> <br /> On wraith terms, Dont ask about kurt cobain.<br /> <br /> proyect twilight its not related to stephanie meyer, stop asking.<br /> <br /> no, theres no HunterCon or Vampirecon.<br /> <br /> No matter how powerful youre, there always will be someone with a termonuclear ray gun aiming at you from SPAAAAAAAAAACE!!!<br /> <br /> Not every shrink is hannibal lecter.<br /> <br /> Hellsing is not a good example of a vampire, <br /> <br /> Always remember, what would Smiling Jack would do.<br /> <br /> German Sex Deviant Tzimitsces are not allowed on the sabbath, we have full toll right now <br /> <br /> The history of the tremere clan can be summed up as &quot;And ill make my own faction, With blackjack...And Hookers!&quot;<br /> <br /> AVOID ASIA AT ALL COST. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T08:19:15-07:00","id":152509,"title":"","content":"1) Dark Lords and their agents can be nice to you, give you gifts, and sympathize with your plight. This does not make them misunderstood good guys, it makes them smart bad guys.<br /> 2) Everyone has to stick their toe in the evil pool once in a while to get things done.<br /> 3) Never forget: every single human has the potential to be more powerful than you <b>overnight</b>, if he is willing to bargain his soul in the process.<br /> 4) Just because you <b><i>can</i></b>, doesn't mean you <b><i>should</i></b>.<br /> 5) Just because you <b><i>should</i></b>, doesn't mean you <b><i>will</i></b>.<br /> 6) Never start a fight with a werewolf (assuming you aren't one yourself) - especially on his home turf while outnumbered.<br /> 7) (Umbral Travel) The shortest distance between here and there is banana muffin.<br /> 8) The solution to almost everything in the World of Darkness: Burn it with Fire.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/PbrO9Kq.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2211-sixfootchicken","name":"SixFootChicken","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"559"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-29T09:26:19-07:00","id":152595,"title":"","content":"Crowley, your Cronenburg Fuck Toy line made me spill my drink. Bravo.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-30T00:48:35-07:00","id":153590,"title":"","content":"1) the older you get the more you realize dead archaic languages should be taught from the first grade on up<br /> 2) if it looks harmless and pretty, its about to kill you<br /> 3) pay attention to glyphs and graffiti, even if you can't read them, recognizing the style can save your life<br /> 4) when some one offers you something for free, they want your soul<br /> 5) never trust a ceilican when death is on the line...<br /> 6) if you just had a supernatural experience and a black sudan rolls up, walk away, don't run. just disappear in to the crowd.<br /> 7) if you find your self in true love after you just met? you're under the thrall of presence/sovereign/the mind sphere/a gift/pathos ect.<br /> 8)don't drink red wine, especially if it taste like Flintstones vitamins.<br /> 9)if someone is looking at you like you're food, its because your about to be<br /> 10)what ever you do, whatever is after you, STAY OUT OF THE SEWERS<br /> 11)when outside of the city, if you hear the howl of a wolf, calmly get back to your car and drive away. don't mess with the grounds and DON'T make a mess.<br /> 13)if you buy something, research who made it, if it says &quot;a subsidiary of Pentex&quot; anywhere on it, destroy it with fire.<br /> 14)when people are talking about &quot;The Prince&quot;, chances are good they are NOT referring to the recording artist...<br /> 15)if you stumble upon a tranquil isolated little place of natural beauty with a palpable sense of emotion or a surreal feeling of magic. back away slowly and forget you ever saw it, its protected and trespassers are likely to disappear<br /> 16) do not under any circumstances go home with that beautiful woman who beckoned you across the dance floor with nothing more than a look.<br /> 17) keep an eye on what every one's wearing. if the answer is &quot;trench coat&quot; they are packing more heat than an active volcano.<br /> 18) Kendo classes seem to be cheap and on every corner, and ancient Japanese swords are a dime a dozen. learn to use one because everyone else will use it on you.<br /> 19) If you live in a house, fortify it with as much as you can. <br /> 20)when you see some shit, and you will see some shit, go to the most populated area you can find. the one with lots and lots of people all around you all at once. if they come for you any ways make a scene and get noticed. they will back off (if they're smart). Avoid shadowy corners and allies at all cost.<br /> 21) just because you don't believe in the supernatural, doesn't mean the supernatural doesn't believe in you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2708-lost_in_the_hedge777","name":"Lost_in_the_Hedge777","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2708_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-30T09:03:55-07:00","id":153908,"title":"","content":"Lol Lost, like your #20","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1552-asssassin","name":"Asssassin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-31T07:40:48-07:00","id":154819,"title":"","content":"I love all of this.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-