ckets, burn the dried mass and bury each bucket and contents in a separate church grounds. Maybe it wasn't the ancient blade of Gilgamesh or whatever so it's not Dead dead, but he ain't gonna get better either.<br /> 4.) Werewolves fight with claws and weapons apparently running ppl over in a car is an improper fighting style. This goes for any combat tactics involving the terms Remote Controlled, Improvised Explosive Device, Indirect Fire, or Air Support. (according to the ST for our BSD game)<br /> 5.) Never go into the water, ever ever ever. Not even fishing.<br /> 6.) Malkavians make poor scouts and spies.<br /> 7.) For a fun time slip some Hunters hallucinogenics.<br /> 8.) Trust anything in the Tabloids that doesn't mention Aliens.<br /> 9.) Buy stock in Pentex and it's subsidiaries, but never use their products.<br /> 10.) Werewolves do not fall for distractions using Beggin Strips, Milkbones, or Kibbles, unless they are bone gnawers.<br /> 11.) Werecats do not take kindly to bribes of catnip.<br /> 12.) One cannot just lease their soul on alternate sundays for power, its a full sale or nothing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2135,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2135-disodium-benzoate","user":"DIsodium Benzoate","date":". 06-26-2014, 10:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2135-disodium-benzoate","name":"DIsodium Benzoate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2135_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-26T20:40:31-07:00","id":181600,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DIsodium Benzoate</strong> <a href=\"https://for