"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","name":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T13:35:29-07:00","id":207477,"title":"","content":"Remember, if you play as a were cat, theres a &quot;No Homo&quot; policy (im looking at you &quot;Lick Wounds.&quot; )","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T17:30:43-07:00","id":207747,"title":"","content":"From my experiences:<br /> <br /> Never trust someone who spells &quot;Magic&quot; with a &quot;k&quot;.<br /> Avoid creepy, strange, little kids like the MF plague.<br /> Never piss off the Frog totem.<br /> Beware the Were-frogs.<br /> Ghosts are indeed effected by gravity.<br /> Not all werecoyotes are assholes, just THAT one.<br /> Hand grenades are not your friends.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1776-sidious","name":"Sidious","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1776_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-31T04:28:29-07:00","id":214536,"title":"","content":"DON'T Embrace any moving thing around only because &quot;it's cool&quot;, odds are the thing could have friends, and they will not be pleased","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>====================================<br /> &quot;Worst English-language User&quot; 2011-2015, 2017 running for the 2018<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ed6RV6Z.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div></div> </div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/515-ryoga84","name":"Ryoga84","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar515_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-31T21:28:18-07:00","id":215526,"title":"","content":"Here's a few I picked up<br /> <br /> 1. If it doesn't die from C4, thermite, white phosphorous, and a flamethrower being applied liberally to their face, leave the region<br /> 2. If you shoot it in the head, cut off it's head, and then burn the body, and it gets back up, it's a good guy or the BBEG<br /> 3. Don't underestimate a punk with a pistol<br /> 4. Never think you're the top of the food chain<br /> 5. Don't trust anything &quot;holy&quot; ever<br /> 6. There is no rule 6.<br /> 7. Always wear sunglasses at night time<br /> 8. Always carry a lighter and a pack of cigarettes<br /> 9. If it's moving and it's not suppose to, duct tape.<br /> 10. Never go into the woods alone.<br /> 11. Silver weapons aren't worth it, you just need to fire more bullets.<br /> 12. Bend the pins on all your grenades so it takes effort to remove them or duct tape down the strike lever.<br /> 13. If it's got an evil aura, don't engage it in melee ever.<br /> 14. When in doubt, C4.<br /> 15. The crazy homeless guy is probably right to some degree.<br /> 16. Avoid the sewers unless you have explosives.<br /> 17. Always carry enough C4 to blow up a building.<br /> 18. Don't underestimate the power of 300 gallons of gasoline in a van tied to a cellphone detonator.<br /> 19. Being shot hurts.<br /> 20. Wear a mask when hunting. Any mask that covers part of your face is enough or see rule #7.<br /> 21. Distance and a sniper rifle are your best bet<br /> 22. Aim for the head.<br /> 23. If it has fangs, it's not your friend.<br /> 24. Never shake someone's hand, ever.<br /> 25. Assume someone is always watching.<br /> 26. Learn sign language.<br /> 27. Only subdue allies, shoot/burn/disembowel the rest.<br /> 28. Never take hostages from the firefight.<br /> 29. Always carry a tool bag<br /> 30. Leave your cellphone at home, use AES-2048 Encrypted Walkie Talkies, and even then speak in riddles.<br /> 31. Change callsigns every mission.<br /> 32. Never compromise in the face of armageddon. Mission isn't over till you're all dead or you're at a safehouse.<br /> 33. Learn to use a hammer and nails.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1VN49Y7tH2ZV0l7Hx65RWX1ez-Q9Lst-8ZTyTJeCTpxM/\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerer 20th</a> homebrew and my update to <a href=\"http://immortalthegathering.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Highlander: the Gathering</a> for 20th Anniversary edition.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2414-theoutlander523","name":"theoutlander523","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}